  "summary": "<p>American manufacturing is surging under President Donald J. Trump. A new report shows the sector expanding for the tenth consecutive month, with production growing at its fastest pace in nearly five years. Factories are expanding. Jobs are returning. Paychecks are rising faster than inflation. And companies are investing trillions to build their futures in America. [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/11/president-trump-is-powering-an-american-manufacturing-renaissance/\">President Trump Is Powering an American Manufacturing Renaissance</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
